Adding the tag in the list will avoid having it reported as unused tag in the container logs in case the new loader service gets removed due to older dependencies.
Given that `symfony/routing` is a mandatory dependency, that special case (using `symfony/routing` 7.3 with FrameworkBundle 7.4+) is the only case where it could have an impact.
